<header><p class="enc-kicker"><a href="/encyclopedia/conflicts/16th-century">Conflicts &amp; Resolutions</a> · Battle</p><h1 class="enc-title">Battle of Agnadello</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates"><a href="/years/1509">1509</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/16th-century">16th century</a> · Also known as Battle of Vailà · Part of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/war-of-the-league-of-cambrai">War of the League of Cambrai</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Battle of Agnadello was fought on 14 May 1509 in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/lombardy">Lombardy</a>, when the French army of Louis XII routed the Venetian army. Coming early in the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/war-of-the-league-of-cambrai">War of the League of Cambrai</a>, it cost <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/venice">Venice</a> almost all of its mainland territories within weeks. Diplomacy and the divisions among its enemies allowed the republic to recover most of the Terraferma by 1517, but its expansion in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/italy">Italy</a> was over.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/battle-of-agnadello.jpg" alt="Battle of Agnadello" width="320" height="451" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Pierre-Jules Jollivet · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Bataille_d%27Agnadel.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
